<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>AUTOHP AND AUTO ATTACK NINJA</Major>
    <Description>This file is configured with a casual timeout to prevent abuse and avoid the system detecting it as a hack due to excessive clicking.
It works for the Ninja with the Katana Slash or the Monk's Clap, but I don't recommend it for other classes since it leads to excessive right-clicking and could be noticeable.

The macro is responsible for repeatedly pressing F1 to heal HP and for pressing the right and left clicks.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 58 1
Delay 20 60 ms
KeyUp 58 1
Delay 20 60 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 20 60 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 20 60 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 20 60 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 20 60 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 20 60 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 20 60 ms
GoWhile 1 999999</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Conquer Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>